		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ふぅ……　グチってても　仕方ないか
マジメに　お仕事　しないとね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-17T07:46:28" />
